Small wonders without tech: Palace (70), Colonial Office (20).
2nd Palace (Feudalism, 40) works as a second center of government.

Notes:
- Barracks: one more veteran level for new military land units, on top
  of the University one (veteran 2 with both).
- Recycling Center: removes 75% of the pollution of the city (both from
  production and from population).
- SDI Defense: 75% chance to shoot down foreign nuclear attacks within
  2 tiles; 100% in the city with the Palace. Also +30% defense against
  missiles (+100% in the Palace city).
- Power Plant: +50% shields in a city with a Factory (Factory + Power
  Plant = +100%).
- Marketplace 50%, Bank 30%, Stock Exchange 40% gold and luxury (120% in
  total).
- Temple: 1 content, 2 with University (not under Communism).
- Port Facility: veteran sea units, full repair of sea units; required for
  Submarines.
- Airport: veteran air units, full repair, airlift; required for all
  aircraft (Fighter, Bomber, Stealth Fighter, Stealth Bomber, AWACS).


