- Roads wonders (from Royale): the city must have the resource in its
  work area. Each gives +10% trade in all your cities, or +5% under
  Federation, Republic and Democracy (no bonus under Anarchy).
- Manhattan Project: see NUCLEAR WEAPONS.
- Marco Polo's Embassy: +30% trade in all cities for all players; the
  owner can build the Trade Company (+10% trade).
- See the in-game help for the other wonder effects.


